@startuml SplitSmartWebFirstDeployment
left to right direction
node "User device" {
  artifact "Supported web browser" as Browser
}
node "Application environment\n(proposed; topology TBD)" {
  artifact "Web presentation" as Web
  artifact "Java 21 application/domain runtime" as App
}
database "Transactional persistence\n(product TBD)" as DB
cloud "Identity / email provider\n(unselected)" as Identity
cloud "Notification channel\n(unselected)" as Notify
cloud "Receipt object storage\n(proposal)" as Receipt
Browser --> Web : HTTPS (proposal)
Web --> App : authenticated application calls
App --> DB : transactional records
App --> Identity
App --> Notify
App --> Receipt
note bottom of App
  Web-first is the path aligned with NFR-001.
  Actual runtime, deployment, and framework are not selected.
end note
@enduml
